      "date": "2026-05-14T11:31:21.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹29.31 (vs ₹29.37 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹29.31 (down from ₹29.37 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹15.8b (up 14% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.04b (flat on FY 2025). Profit margin: 6.6% (down from 7.5% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 7% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 26% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
